{"id": "DeoWO9tjGwy", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "Is this photo real or A.I.? These days you honestly can't tell. Here's how to check. 🔍\n\n1. Hands and text: A.I. still messes up fingers, earrings and the writing on signs and boards.\n2. Light and shadows: two people in one photo, shadows falling in different directions? Something's off.\n3. Hidden tags: Google's SynthID is an invisible watermark software can detect, and many companies add a Content Credentials label showing how an image was made. But screenshots and edits can strip labels, and not every tool adds them.\n\nThe biggest tool is your brain: find the source first, then share.\n\nSend this to the family group that forwards everything 😅\n\n#ai #aiimages #factcheck #deepfake #techinhindi", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1792315271, "like_count": 39, "comment_count": 2, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18141395332575820a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 58.858, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQP3vyCAB5NCHaPyC6I-Lb_zav_sA9xQL-y7E3Xo11HYb4IyH6yNLAZNn3J5wdXhB6Uy58LBHYBK01SzrBl-GvQgctVD-43ekbp6lFQ.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=AdpWONZfHA8LqDOyqD9dphAns7QFNLlFMG5rB7CqUOrpgVVE490mea-SeELx-q3GGLMM0ZxUEZZljENUtaezRIbo&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=YN-_VOf9aoEQ7kNvwEf69l8&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=4rW3v4mnEMHdbtNzgHT6aw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTcdNMOzFLc8XvZr_5y-7EpzH9HB7UD5WsPRl3gyHJBDQ&oe=6AF400BB", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 58.858, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gec